    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm planning a big gala for a law firm (about 500 people) and we just got a bunch of last minute updates. We have quite a few guests with severe nut allergies and a good number of vegans. How should I professionally communicate these specific dietary requirements to the catering kitchen staff to make sure nothing gets missed, and what's the best way to label the buffet so people feel safe eating?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
