      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should send the updated guest list, explicitly highlighting the number of guests with severe nut allergies and their vegan dietary needs, directly to the catering manager with a formal \"No Transmission\" protocol for allergens. Request that the kitchen prepares a dedicated allergen-free station and provides staff with written verification that no ingredients have been switched post-treatment for safety reasons. For labeling, implement color-coded signs with clear icons and text matching the severity of the risk, such as \"Contains Nuts\" or \"Vegan Only,\" to ensure uninformed guests immediately identify safe options.",
