    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds solid. One concern though is the kitchen staff might get overwhelmed with so many specific requests during the rush. Do you have any advice on how to keep the communication streamlined so nothing gets lost in the chaos right before service starts?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
