      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To prevent chaos, create a single, color-coded \"Allergen MasterSheet\" that the kitchen prints and displays at every prep station for immediate visual reference during peak times. Designate a single liaison person within the event team whose sole job during service is to take live updates and re-issue this master sheet to the kitchen without interrupting their actual preparation flow. Additionally, record the final menu in a digital format accessible via tablet or QR code at the kitchen pass to allow staff to scan and instantly verify specific dish components against allergy rules before serving.",
